# help cards: a button held alone shows what it does; letting go does nothing else
wait 2000
press REC
wait 1200
shot help_rec.png
release REC
wait 300
expect loops 1
press EDIT
wait 1200
shot help_edit.png
release EDIT
expect frozen 0
press HOME
wait 1200
shot help_home.png
release HOME
press SAVE
wait 1000
shot help_save.png
release SAVE
expect store_writes 0
# a button with no job here has no card
press LFO
wait 1200
release LFO
expect view 0
